<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 02:13:15 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>商会和大学理事会讨论美国高中缺失的科目：商业</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/12/business-missing-american-high-schools-chamber-commerce-college-board/</link><description>学生们从高中毕业，却不清楚组织如何运作、资金如何流动以及想法如何变成机会。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2148292315-e1789006913832.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 12:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/12/business-missing-american-high-schools-chamber-commerce-college-board/</guid></item><item><title>“我们所有人都要付钱”：30% 的美国人使用 BNPL 贷款来支付食品杂货，这可能会让你付出代价</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/14/buy-now-pay-later-groceries-raising-sticker-prices-for-consumers-retailer-margins/</link><description>华盛顿大学的一项研究发现，随着越来越多的消费者为购物提供资金，所有人的商品成本都会上升。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2257929328-e1789407217933.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 17:54:01 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/14/buy-now-pay-later-groceries-raising-sticker-prices-for-consumers-retailer-margins/</guid></item><item><title>五角大楼承认伊朗的空袭损坏并摧毁了美国在中东基地的数百座建筑</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/14/pentagon-damage-report-iran-war-hundreds-buildings-us-bases-aircraft/</link><description>报告指出，美国与伊朗的战争“导致了战略库存短缺，并暴露了弹药补给的工业基础瓶颈”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26257809964809-e1789427612868.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 23:18:40 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/14/pentagon-damage-report-iran-war-hundreds-buildings-us-bases-aircraft/</guid></item><item><title>沙特阿拉伯于 20 世纪 80 年代修建了东西向管道，以防伊朗关闭霍尔木兹海峡。德黑兰支持的民兵仍在炮轰，导致油价上涨</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/14/saudi-arabia-east-west-pipeline-iran-hormuz-militias-iraq-oil-prices/</link><description>两名地区官员告诉美联社，修复工作可能需要三到五周的时间。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26256645701245-e1789426653299.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 23:09:37 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/14/saudi-arabia-east-west-pipeline-iran-hormuz-militias-iraq-oil-prices/</guid></item><item><title>马克·卡尼向全球投资者推销加拿大“不仅仅是毗邻美国”，而且是“尊重法治”的可靠合作伙伴</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/14/mark-carney-canada-global-investors-summit-trump-tariffs-trade-war-rule-of-law/</link><description>“他们是因为加拿大才来的，”他说。 “如果他们想去美国，他们就会去美国。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2290963979-e1789425921411.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 22:50:01 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/14/mark-carney-canada-global-investors-summit-trump-tariffs-trade-war-rule-of-law/</guid></item><item><title>亿万富翁迈克·布隆伯格 (Mike Bloomberg) 在为所罗门兄弟 (Salomon Brothers) 奉献了 15 年职业生涯后被解雇，第二天早上，他创立了自己的媒体帝国</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/billionaire-mike-bloomberg-fired-15-year-career-at-salomon-brothers-next-morning-founded-media-empire/</link><description>迈克·布隆伯格 (Mike Bloomberg) 最初在所罗门兄弟 (Salomon Brothers) 担任职员，年薪 9,000 美元，后来晋升为合伙人，最后被解雇。他没有任何怨恨，并从拒绝中吸取了重要的教训。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/GettyImages-456876524-e1758133656454.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 13:30:45 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/billionaire-mike-bloomberg-fired-15-year-career-at-salomon-brothers-next-morning-founded-media-empire/</guid></item><item><title>戴尔最新的重塑就在这里——它揭示了人工智能的繁荣正在“本地”发生。市场错过了它</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/08/dell-earnings-reveal-ai-buildout-on-premise/</link><description>最近的井喷季度可能是这家始于迈克尔·戴尔宿舍的科技公司的第 12 次重塑。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2276442198-e1788810890393.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 08 Sep 2026 12:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/08/dell-earnings-reveal-ai-buildout-on-premise/</guid></item><item><title>“将你的热情与投资策略相结合”：与风险投资家会面，使用 500,000 个神奇宝贝和交易卡来对冲债务危机</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/12/venture-capital-500000-pokemon-trading-cards-debt-crisis/</link><description>彼得·莱文 (Peter Levin) 认为收藏品和交易卡将继续留在另类资产市场。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Image-Aug-19-2026-05_49_20-PM-e1789161152287.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 09:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/12/venture-capital-500000-pokemon-trading-cards-debt-crisis/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普告诉美国人不要“杀金鹅”，拒绝选民反对人工智能和数据中心</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/14/trump-ai-data-centers-golden-goose-iq/</link><description>伯尼·桑德斯 (Bernie Sanders) 和史蒂夫·班农 (Steve Bannon) 正在联合起来反对人工智能，就像 2016 年政治时代的另一位主角特朗普主张加速一样。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2294419035-e1789417196491.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 20:20:51 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/14/trump-ai-data-centers-golden-goose-iq/</guid></item><item><title>这家拉斯维加斯赌场刚刚向近万名员工发放了价值超过 7000 万美元的公司股票，以庆祝其 50 岁生日</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/14/las-vegas-casino-10000-workers-70-million-company-stock-red-rock-resort-spa-fertitta/</link><description>每位符合资格的员工每年在工作期间可获得 1,000 美元的 Red Rock Resorts 股票。一名 1977 年入职的工人拿到了 49,000 美元。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2294411667-e1789414366177.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 20:20:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/14/las-vegas-casino-10000-workers-70-million-company-stock-red-rock-resort-spa-fertitta/</guid></item></channel></rss>